{"name":"Granite Falls","hex":"#638496","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Granite Falls","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A city, the county seat of Yellow Medicine County, Minnesota, United States, located in Chippewa County, Renville County and Yellow Medicine County.","A town in Caldwell County, North Carolina, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Granite_Falls"}],"entries":[{"title":"Granite Falls, Minnesota","blocks":[{"text":"Granite Falls is a city located mostly in Yellow Medicine County, Minnesota, of which it is the county seat with a small portion in Chippewa County, Minnesota. The population was 2,737 at the 2020 census. The Andrew John Volstead House, a National Historic Landmark (NHL), is located in Granite Falls. Another NHL located in Granite Falls is the Julian A. Weaver House."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Granite_Falls_Minnesota.jpg/330px-Granite_Falls_Minnesota.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Granite_Falls%2C_Minnesota","wikidata":"Q1005637"},{"title":"Granite Falls Township, Chippewa County, Minnesota","blocks":[{"text":"Granite Falls Township is a township in Chippewa County, Minnesota, United States. The population was 222 at the 2000 census."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Granite_Falls_Township%2C_Chippewa_County%2C_Minnesota","wikidata":"Q1901325"},{"title":"Granite","blocks":[{"text":"Granite is a coarse-grained (phaneritic) intrusive igneous rock composed mostly of quartz, alkali feldspar, mica and plagioclase. It forms from magma with a high content of silica and alkali metal oxides that slowly cools and solidifies underground. It is common in the continental crust of Earth, where it is found in igneous intrusions. These range in size from dikes only a few centimeters across to batholiths exposed over hundreds of square kilometers."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Bianco_Sardo_Granit_mit_polierter_Oberfl%C3%A4che.jpg/330px-Bianco_Sardo_Granit_mit_polierter_Oberfl%C3%A4che.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Granite","wikidata":"Q41177"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yellow_Medicine_County_Courthouse.jpg/500px-Yellow_Medicine_County_Courthouse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yellow_Medicine_County_Courthouse.jpg/1280px-Yellow_Medicine_County_Courthouse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yellow_Medicine_County_Courthouse.jpg/500px-Yellow_Medicine_County_Courthouse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Yellow Medicine County Courthouse","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYellow_Medicine_County_Courthouse.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Granite_Rosa_Porri%C3%B1o_-_es_%28rotated%29.jpg/500px-Granite_Rosa_Porri%C3%B1o_-_es_%28rotated%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Granite_Rosa_Porri%C3%B1o_-_es_%28rotated%29.jpg/1280px-Granite_Rosa_Porri%C3%B1o_-_es_%28rotated%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Granite_Rosa_Porri%C3%B1o_-_es_%28rotated%29.jpg/500px-Granite_Rosa_Porri%C3%B1o_-_es_%28rotated%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGranite_Rosa_Porri%C3%B1o_-_es_(rotated).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Granite_BA